* AT89S52 - Simple RC Reset Simulation

* Power supply: 0V to 5V in 1ms
VDD vdd 0 PWL(0 0 1m 5 20m 5)

* RC reset network
R1 rst 0 10k
C1 vdd rst 10u

* Transient analysis
.tran 10u 1500m

* Plot results

.control
run

meas tran t_rise WHEN v(rst)=2.5 RISE=1
meas tran t_fall WHEN v(rst)=2.5 FALL=1

let pulse_duration = t_fall - t_rise

print t_rise
print t_fall
print pulse_duration

.endc

.end
